            "review_title": "Review at Shakti Nhà Hàng Chay & Cafe",
            "review_text": "Thuy N\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam16 contributions\n0\nA delicious vegetarian place in Phu Nhuan\nJul 2023 • Family\nCute space, delicious vegetarian dishes without MSG, fake vegetarian foods that are salty so I feel secure. The staff at the restaurant advised me that the broth here is stewed from more than 10 types of vegetables so the broth has a good taste. light, naturally sweet. When I got home, I ordered takeout and was quite surprised by the meticulousness. The food was carefully packaged in a bagasse box, thinking the restaurant sold it out of passion or something. The dishes here only start at 29k. Highly recommend everyone to come experience it.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten August 1, 2023",
